---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Why and What of this page"
	pubDate={new Date('June 16 2025')}
>
	<p>
		I'm Omar, a CS student (June 2026 grad.) passionate about Computer Science, still
		at the begginning of my journey and career. When I am not lazing around I read and
		experiment with distributed systems, functional programming, and whatever else
		catches my eye.
	</p>

	<p>
	    Over the years I have learned many lessons and experimented with a lot of
	    technologies and techniques, and I think some of them are worth writing
	    about.  Maybe someone will find useful some of the things I document, and
	    that's the best I can hope for.

		This page also doubles as a portfolio, a place to showcase and
		describe my personal projects.
	</p>

  <p> If you found anything interesting and want to reach out to me, email me at
  <a href="mailto:omar@yoyojambo.com">omar@yoyojambo.com</a>, and I'll get back to you.</p>

	<p>
		I themed this page after my emacs preferred theme, doom-one, part of
		the <a href="https://github.com/doomemacs/themes">Doom emacs theme megapack</a>.
		You can also use a more traditional dark or light theme, if you don't like it. I'm
		new to frontend dev so if anything looks decent, that's on accident, but I'm doing
		my best over here.
	</p>
</Layout>
